{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29605","headline":"即目 · 李商隐","name":"即目","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地宽楼已迥，人更迥於楼。\n细意经春物，伤酲属暮愁。\n望赊殊易断，恨久欲难收。\n大埶真无利，多情岂自由。\n空园兼树废，败港拥花流。\n书去青枫驿，鸿归杜若洲。\n单栖应分定，辞疾索谁忧。\n更替林鵶恨，惊频去不休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}